{
  "format": "rustsheet-case/v1",
  "description": "What a column edit made in the application does to a filtered table's hidden rows. Table Sales on S!A1:C7 (Cat a,b,a,c,a,b; Val 1-6; Ext 10-60) with a values filter on Cat keeping \"a\" (rows 3, 5, 7 hidden). Sheet F: A1:A4 SUBTOTAL 3, 103, 9, 109 over Sales[Val]; A5:A8 the same over Sales[Ext]; A9 ROWS(Sales); A10 COLUMNS(Sales). SUBTOTAL 3 against 103 tells filtered rows from rows left hidden by hand (T-4371). The edit: insert_column at B inserts a column inside the table, right of the filtered Cat column. F!A11 = INDEX(Sales[#Headers],1,2) reads the inserted column's header back; S!B1 expects that text by hand (the oracle records formula cells only).",
  "tags": [
    "M8",
    "tables",
    "probe"
  ],
  "sheets": [
    {
      "name": "S",
      "cells": {
        "A1": "Cat",
        "B1": "Val",
        "C1": "Ext",
        "A2": "a",
        "B2": 1,
        "C2": 10,
        "A3": "b",
        "B3": 2,
        "C3": 20,
        "A4": "a",
        "B4": 3,
        "C4": 30,
        "A5": "c",
        "B5": 4,
        "C5": 40,
        "A6": "a",
        "B6": 5,
        "C6": 50,
        "A7": "b",
        "B7": 6,
        "C7": 60
      },
      "hidden_rows": [
        3,
        5,
        7
      ],
      "tables": [
        {
          "name": "Sales",
          "ref": "A1:C7",
          "filter": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "F",
      "cells": {
        "A1": "=SUBTOTAL(3,Sales[Val])",
        "A2": "=SUBTOTAL(103,Sales[Val])",
        "A3": "=SUBTOTAL(9,Sales[Val])",
        "A4": "=SUBTOTAL(109,Sales[Val])",
        "A5": "=SUBTOTAL(3,Sales[Ext])",
        "A6": "=SUBTOTAL(103,Sales[Ext])",
        "A7": "=SUBTOTAL(9,Sales[Ext])",
        "A8": "=SUBTOTAL(109,Sales[Ext])",
        "A9": "=ROWS(Sales)",
        "A10": "=COLUMNS(Sales)",
        "A11": "=INDEX(Sales[#Headers],1,2)"
      }
    }
  ],
  "sheet_ops": [
    {
      "op": "insert_column",
      "sheet": "S",
      "column": "B"
    }
  ],
  "expected": {
    "S!B1": {
      "t": "s",
      "v": "Column1"
    }
  },
  "check": [
    "F!A1",
    "F!A2",
    "F!A3",
    "F!A4",
    "F!A5",
    "F!A6",
